(footprint "DT13-6P"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "TE Connectivity DEUTSCH DT13-6P, sealed automotive PCB header receptacle, 6 positions, RIGHT ANGLE (90deg) molded pins, FLANGED front panel mount; DEUTSCH size 16 contacts, 13 A on 14-16 AWG / 10 A on 18 AWG / 7.5 A on 20 AWG, 250 VAC/VDC, -55..+125 degC, 100 mating cycles, 20 G / 10-2000 Hz per 108-151009 rev E (22AUG2024); that spec rates IP68/IP6K9K for the INLINE plug+receptacle with rear protection only - headers and flanged versions are listed Not Tested. NO KEYING VARIANT EXISTS BELOW 8 POSITIONS (A/B/C/D keys are 8- and 12-way only), so the position count is the only mechanical anti-mismating against the 4-way DT13-4P. Mates with DT06-6S-XXXX plug + W6S wedge lock. Geometry from TE customer drawing DT13-6P + application spec 114-151046 rev A (28AUG2020) sec.3.4, cross-checked against TE STEP model C-DT13-6P, agreement 0.001 mm. PCB layout: 6x finished hole D1.88 +/-0.05 (pin D1.5622), pin pitch 4.445 x 6.35 mm; 3x NPTH D3.43 +0.12/-0.00 for #4-20 Plastite 48 thread-forming screws, pair 21.7424 mm apart, third hole 11.430 mm toward the panel on the pair axis midpoint. Pins 1-2-3 are the far row (Y=0), pins 4-5-6 the row nearer the panel (Y=6.35). Mating axis sits 17.856 mm above the PCB top surface; pins protrude 3.10 +/-0.64 below it. Panel inner face (seal land) is 22.377 mm from the pin-1 row (Dwgs.User line); flange 42.799 x 35.484, overall body 42.80 (X) x 39.507 (Y); the shroud protrudes 14.072 mm in front of the panel; cutout centre at X=+2.9533, 17.856 mm above the PCB top. Panel cutout option 2: 25.17 (screw axis) x 21.84, 4x R6.35, plus 2x D3.94 for #6-19 screws on the screw axis 32.893 mm apart; panel 6.25 mm max. CAVEAT: application-spec fig. 3.4 is drawn as seen from the connector underside; this footprint follows the STEP model and the mating-face view. If the fab NPTH tolerance is negative, order the mounting holes at 3.45-3.50 (spec allows 3.43 to 3.55). https://www.te.com/en/product-DT13-6P.html")
	(tags "connector DEUTSCH DT DT13 6 pin position right angle 90deg flange panel mount sealed automotive TE size 16 13A header receptacle")
